    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Ericsson LM Telephone Co describes itself as a company that powers the networks connecting billions, with a focus on 5G, AI-driven automation, and enterprise connectivity that unites 5G, AI, and cloud. Its website discusses advanced 5G capabilities such as network slicing, orchestration, and AI-driven tools, and presents 6G as an \"intelligent fabric\" connecting people and machines through mobile, cloud, and AI systems. The company also describes building trusted AI for networks, stating that AI is transforming telecom and that trust will determine how far it can go.\n\nThe company positions AI as central to its connectivity offerings, mentioning AI-driven automation and AI-driven tools for superior connectivity and tailored solutions. Its site cites AT&T's Open RAN transformation as an example of an open, disaggregated, and programmable network that can accelerate innovation and network automation.\n\nEricsson LM Telephone Co is a public company traded under the ticker ERIC, headquartered in Stockholm, Sweden. It is also known as ERICSSON (LM) TEL-SP ADR, and its SEC CIK is 0000717826.",
